### Fix #2 & #5 & #10 & #11 – Hero Image (LCP-Hauptverursacher)

```html
<!-- ❌ VORHER -->
<head>
  <!-- Kein Preload, kein fetchpriority -->
</head>
<body>
  <img src="/images/hero-laptop-raw.png" class="hero">
  <!-- 5MB PNG, keine Dimensionen, kein alt -->
</body>
```

```html
<!-- ✅ NACHHER -->
<head>
  <!-- 1. Frühzeitig preloaden (höchste Priorität im Waterfall) -->
  <link rel="preload" 
        as="image" 
        href="/images/hero-laptop.avif"
        imagesrcset="/images/hero-laptop-800.avif 800w,
                     /images/hero-laptop-1200.avif 1200w"
        imagesizes="100vw"
        fetchpriority="high">
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 2. Komprimiert (AVIF ~150KB statt 5MB PNG) + Dimensionen + Priorität -->
  <img src="/images/hero-laptop.avif"
       srcset="/images/hero-laptop-800.avif 800w,
               /images/hero-laptop-1200.avif 1200w"
       sizes="100vw"
       width="1200" 
       height="600"
       fetchpriority="high"
       class="hero"
       alt="Premium Laptop Frontansicht">
</body>
```

