### Fix #9 – Bootstrap nicht render-blocking laden

```html
<!-- ❌ VORHER: Blockiert komplettes Rendering -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.example.com/bootstrap.min.css">
```

```html
<!-- ✅ NACHHER: Critical CSS inline + Bootstrap async -->
<head>
  <!-- Preconnect für schnellere DNS/TLS -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.example.com">

  <!-- Critical CSS inline (Above-the-fold Styles) -->
  <style>
    /* Nur die Styles für Hero + Header */
    .hero { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    header { /* ... */ }
  </style>

  <!-- Bootstrap non-blocking nachladen -->
  <link rel="preload" 
        href="https://cdn.example.com/bootstrap.min.css" 
        as="style" 
        onload="this.rel='stylesheet'">
  <noscript>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.example.com/bootstrap.min.css">
  </noscript>
</head>
```

